==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**4 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Mr. Mer]] spawns.
**1 [[Mr. Mer]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The name of the game here is killing each Ragin' Gory as they spawn, while minimizing how much space Mr. Mer and Elder Sloth take up. [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack]] tanks lots of damage against the Gories and Elder Sloth, while [[Soap Cat]] has a high healthpool and tanks hits from Elder Sloth. On the offensive side, [[Hitman Cat]] does huge amounts of damage against the Mers, [[Pizza Cat]] deals high damage and can even catch Sir Rels with a Wave, and [[Awakened Naala]] is your main source of damage against both Mr. Mer and the Sir Rels.

===Recommended Ubers===

* [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kasa Jizo]] has [[Massive Damage|massive damage]] against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark enemies]], therefore, he makes quick work of the [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gorys]] and [[Gory Dark|Gory Darks]] on this stage. With fast attacks, he can juggle and kill [[Sir Rel|Sir Rels]] while also being able to chip down at the other threats on this stage.

* [[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salavation's Daughter Lunacia]] can block [[Mr. Mer|Mr. Mer's]] [[Wave Attack|waves]] while also [[freeze|freezing]] the [[Elder Sloth]] and [[Sir Rel|Sir Rels]].

